{% endif %}
```

`freeze` (Docker required) builds a distributable firmware image with
`firmware/` frozen in — the artifact lands in `dist/` and is attached to
GitHub Releases by CI. Type-checking the firmware needs the stubs installed
first (`stubs` above); `tests/` (the CPython core tests) and `firmware/core/`
are checked without them.
